The adapted files re-implement Palace algorithms and structure in JavaScript; no Palace source text is copied. Each
adapted file states in its header the Palace files it follows and what was changed. They came to this package from
advanced-packaging-atlas engine/src/em3d/ at fe39985 (whose em3d/NOTICE this file carries over for the files ported
here). These files are distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later (repository LICENSE); the Apache-2.0 terms continue to
apply to the portions derived from Palace.

Adapted files:
- src/la/krylov.mjs  <- palace/linalg/iterative.cpp (GMRES)
- src/la/pmg.mjs     <- palace/linalg/gmg.cpp, palace/linalg/distrelaxation.cpp, palace/models/spaceoperator.cpp
                        (p-multigrid V-cycle, Hiptmair distributive relaxation, preconditioner from the complex system)
- src/la/ams.mjs     <- palace/linalg/ams.cpp (AMS structure; not wired into a solver yet)

Not ported to this package (stay in advanced-packaging-atlas em3d/): lumped.mjs, prom.mjs.
